1
00:00:02,269 --> 00:00:06,780
<b>Equipe inSanos:
Northmen - A viking saga</b>

2
00:00:06,781 --> 00:00:09,781
<b>Legenda:
Fefavrin | Sardinha | Petrogui</b>

3
